###STEP 1 – Home Route
GET http://localhost:5000/

### STEP 2 – Register Organizer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Cheran",
    "email":"cheran@gmail.com",
    "password":"password123"
}

### STEP 3 – Login
# @name login

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"cheran@gmail.com",
    "password":"password123"
}

### STEP 4 – Create Singles Tournament
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Inter College Singles",
    "sport":"Badminton",
    "format":"Singles",
    "fixtureType":"Random",
    "date":"2026-09-10"
}

### STEP 5 – Create Doubles Tournament
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Inter College Doubles",
    "sport":"Badminton",
    "format":"Doubles",
    "fixtureType":"Random",
    "date":"2026-09-15"
}

### STEP 6 – Verify Tournaments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments

### STEP 7 – Register Singles Players
POST http://localhost:5000/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
