### STEP 9 – Verify Registrations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/registrations

### STEP 10 – Automatic Team Generation
POST http://localhost:5000/api/teams/auto/3
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### STEP 11 – View Teams
GET http://localhost:5000/api/teams

### STEP 12 – Generate Singles Fixtures
POST http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/random/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### STEP 13 – View Fixtures
GET http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/1

### STEP 14 – Generate Doubles Fixtures
POST http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/random/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### STEP 15 – Update Scores(Change the fixture no to change all the matches)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/score/7
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "playerAScore":21,
    "playerBScore":17
}

### STEP 16 – Generate Next Round
POST http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/next-round/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

