### STEP 18 – Manual Teams (Optional)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tournamentId":4,
    "teamName":"Team Delta",
    "player1":"Player7",
    "player2":"Player8"
}

### STEP 19 – Manual Fixtures
POST http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/manual/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fixtures":[
        {
            "playerA":"Team Alpha",
            "playerB":"Team Beta"
        },
        {
            "playerA":"Team Gamma",
            "playerB":"Team Delta"
        }
    ]
}

### Get Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/leaderboard/1

### Schedule Match

POST http://localhost:5000/api/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fixtureId": 1,
    "court": "Court 1",
    "matchDate": "2026-09-15",
    "startTime": "10:00",
    "endTime": "10:45",
    "referee": "Mr. Kumar"
}

### Get Fixtures
GET http://localhost:5000/api/fixtures/1